    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esekieli ghwareakghu buudeagaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ea orjeeda siida, geani ng'uta ng'aniip, ak gireakghuti gawuurji weembe. Ak gireaghwi uhuudaang'u ea deamuukaagu. Ng'ata gigeanu gisiiteena haleanjeeda ak giideeni buudeagaagu ak gilajayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata neaweesiinda mujiineeda Yerusalemu abeeda gighwardi gheamughuushcheanjagi aba jeeda gea asamwagu bea buudeagaagu aba jeeda mujiini. Gheamughuushcheanda niirja gaybwaraada aba ng'uta nea gineaweesi mujiini, nea gheamughuushcheanda huuydean gajadaarda aba jeameeda, ak gaydafagu ng'uteanyu daat geeshta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gigeanu buudeesu ng'ay aba jeedeaba suh, ak girasi weeleeda hang'daang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygeani buudeesu ng'ay aba jeedeaba suh ak gijaksi jeeda beasta, ak gayghwaak beasta, ak gayghwahidu beasta leabu jeedeaba buudeesu ak beastida gayghaghwarda fuga Israeli sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, nih Yerusalemu gil, naayiinyi bugusta eemoojiga nea gwaneaweesa meadajeagaaschi darooraka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea niheawa deaweedajeegeasu, nea gwasin ng'asheega munyas ea ghwanaawa eemoojisu, ak saawa ghaheawa huumeanyeeka ea ghwanaawa darooraksu neaweesean. Aba gideaba niheawa deaweedajeegeasu, nea mwaada geeshta huumeanyeekeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba agooga noaheawanaan ea ghang'al eemoojiga neaweeseegwa, nea moayaadi geeshta hamurajeegeasu, nea moang'waanyi hamurajeegeasu, nea moosindani giduurji searoojiga eemoojiga neaweeseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ng'ula aniini, geawooschi haweewaneey ak gaydasin girgweageeda aba dageascheadaang'u aba madeeda eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badayda ng'asheegeagwa munyas sean anyareasan, gaydasimaneegwa gidaghayi miidasimaneegwa ak ea maygut dabiikta gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba hooweani bea jeeda mujiiniin ghweaniga gayghwaak diibiga nyaawa, nea diibiga ghwaak ghweaniga nyaawa. Ak gajanyasa girgweaksiinda nea boosteanga gaydaadaarda gaweay meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badaydeaba nih aba gideabiideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba huumwa bea gideaba ning'udi ririnnyeanda heedeanyu ghaydit, aba sinaweagaagu sean aasichi ea gidinyareastanaan sean. Aba badaydeaba nih gaydahistaneegwa, asheagiida nea maydabwaydaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu ng'ay aba jeedeang'wa, gayghabwar dawni ea jalooda, nea gheamughuushcheeka suurja gajeabwar aba ng'ucheeda nea gheamughuushcheeka abit gaydaadabwaarda gaweay meadajeega sean bea ng'eanyiida ak gaydaat geeshta aba ng'uta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak nih ea gichea gooshealda nyarasteanyu gil, nea gajea naanung' ghwasiinda nyarasteanyu nea naamwaschi aba jeedeanyu. Abeeda gayghwanal gideaba aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gil, ak geanyareeksi saawa aba gideaba mandeawana doobiiwnata aba heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' huwa raghoonyeanda, ea baspaseega aba bugusta eemoojiga neaweeseey ea madeeda buuneesean ng'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gayhuuwa gichea eefool bea baspaseega, gawuurji gida anyareas fih aba heeda eemooji neaweeseey aba damanda jea dasina girgweaksiindeanyu aba headaang'u aba nyarasteanyu ng'waan gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damandida gaydasiksa geatkeasu ng'weani bea jalooda ak gafteegwa nea ghwalas uhuuda fugaagu. Ak gaydanung' ghabwar jalooda nea ghaadataschi heeda siitiiwiisa hamita nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydeadu headaang'u jalooda ea diyeanga ng'weani jea ghoareanyi diibigaagu, ea geeyoonung'weaka munyas, ea nuusta buuneeda, ak gayghwahidu ng'ucheeda jea ghwalas uhuudaang'u, gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
